    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25475" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαπαύ-ω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bring to an end, conclude,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν βίον,</span> i.e. <i>die,</i> prob.
			in <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				494.4
			</span></i> (Delph., <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>):—
				Med.
			, <i>rest between times, pause,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				191c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>R.</u>
				336b
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ στρατιαὶ διεπέπαυντο</span>”
				<i>had ceased for the time being,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>HG</u>
					4.4.14
				</span></i>
			.</div>
